          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Friendly Astartes boarding parties gain +1 and re-roll one die; Flagship issues 3 Fleet Orders each phase; may accompany Teleport Assault.</characteristic>
